      "part": "problem",
      "original_record": "before",
      "value": "|  | $Y=2$ | $Y=4$ | $Y=6$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=1$ | $0.1$ | $0.25$ | $0.25$ |\n| $X=2$ | $0.05$ | $0.15$ | $0.2$ |\n\nCompute $P((X,Y)\\in \\{(1,4),(1,6),(2,6)\\})$ given that the random variables $X$ and $Y$ have the joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ shown in the table above.",
