    {
      "part": "worked_solution",
      "original_record": "history",
      "value": "Using the values in the table, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P((X,Y)\\in \\{(1,4),(1,6),(2,6)\\}) & =P((X,Y)=(1,4)) \\\\  & +P((X,Y)=(1,6)) \\\\  & +P((X,Y)=(2,6)) \\\\  & =f(1,4)+f(1,6)+f(2,6) \\\\  & =0.25+0.25+0.2 \\\\  & =0.7.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
